OL,3,AZelensky says US intelligence sharing
OL,4,A'works now' after talks with Trump
OL,5,Aenvoy in Oslo
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas said US intelligence sharing on
OL,9,Fdeadly Russian missile attacks "works
OL,10,Fnow" after talks with President Donald
OL,11,FTrump's special envoy Steve Witkoff.
OL,13,FThe meeting in Oslo came after
OL,14,Faccusations by Kyiv that Washington was
OL,15,Fwithholding key intelligence - a claim
OL,16,Frejected as "scandalous" by US
OL,17,FSecretary of State Marco Rubio.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
