OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky says US intelligence sharing
OL,4,A'works now' after talks with Trump
OL,5,Aenvoy in Oslo
OL,6,
OL,7,FFinnish President Alexander Stubb, who
OL,8,Falso took part in the talks, said
OL,9,F"genuine progress" was made on
OL,10,Fproposals to achieve peace but gave no
OL,11,Fdetails and warned that patience would
OL,12,Fbe needed.
OL,14,FZelensky and his European allies said
OL,15,Fit was now up to Russia to respond to
OL,16,Fthe proposals agreed in Oslo when
OL,17,FWitkoff arrives in St Petersburg on
OL,18,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
